      "title": "Studio Photometric Composite",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "StudioPhotometricComposite -\nThese controls shape the input plate before FLUX ever touches it.\n\nlighting_strength (Default 1.0): \n\nTry 1.5 \u2013 2.2: Force extreme directional contrast and deep carving shadows.\nTry 0.6 \u2013 0.8: Gentle beauty studio wash.\n\nspecular_kick (Default 1.5):\n\nTry 2.5 \u2013 3.0: Makes wet skin, metallic chains, and patent leather explode with crisp catchlights.\n\nfilmic_white_point (Default 3.5):\n\nTry 1.8 \u2013 2.2: Soft vintage film roll-off (highlights compress early, no blown-out whites).\nTry 6.0 \u2013 8.0: Punchy, crisp digital look with high dynamic range ceiling."
      ],
