      "title": "Pass 2 KSampler",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "The #1 King Lever: Pass 2 KSampler denoise\n\nThis determines how much FLUX redraws the image to adopt the new 3D lighting versus keeping the original geometry.\n\n0.30 \u2013 0.40 (Surgical Polish):\nResult: 100% preserves original face, wrinkles, and fabric details. Only adds subtle specular sheen and surface tints.\n\n0.50 \u2013 0.60 (The Golden Sweet Spot):\nResult: FLUX generatively re-synthesizes realistic subsurface scattering on skin, new bounce light in the eyes, and glossy highlights on leather without losing the person's identity.\n\n0.70 \u2013 0.80 (High Chiaroscuro / Dramatic):\nResult: Extreme light transformation (e.g. converting daylight to moody night film noir), but fine facial features or jewelry details may slightly drift."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "The #1 King Lever: Pass 2 KSampler denoise\n\nThis determines how much FLUX redraws the image to adopt the new 3D lighting versus keeping the original geometry.\n\n0.30 \u2013 0.40 (Surgical Polish):\nResult: 100% preserves original face, wrinkles, and fabric details. Only adds subtle specular sheen and surface tints.\n\n0.50 \u2013 0.60 (The Golden Sweet Spot):\nResult: FLUX generatively re-synthesizes realistic subsurface scattering on skin, new bounce light in the eyes, and glossy highlights on leather without losing the person's identity.\n\n0.70 \u2013 0.80 (High Chiaroscuro / Dramatic):\nResult: Extreme light transformation (e.g. converting daylight to moody night film noir), but fine facial features or jewelry details may slightly drift."
      },
      "color": "#243440",
      "bgcolor": "#10202c"
    },
    {
      "id": 41,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -2620,
        -260
      ],
      "size": [
        430,
        640
      ],
      "flags": {
