      "title": "INFO",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# \ud83d\udca1 StudioLight: Method A Calibrated\n### Professional 3-Point Photometric Lighting Console\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 Required Models & Storage Paths\n\n* **Diffusion Model (UNET):**\n  `flux1-krea-dev.safetensors` *(or standard `flux1-dev.safetensors`)*\n  \ud83d\udcc1 `ComfyUI/models/unet/` or `diffusion_models/`\n\n* **Text Encoders (CLIP):**\n  `clip_l.safetensors` + `t5xxl_fp16.safetensors` *(or fp8)*\n  \ud83d\udcc1 `ComfyUI/models/clip/`\n\n* **VAE:**\n  `ae.safetensors`\n  \ud83d\udcc1 `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n* **Preprocessors (Auto-downloaded by ControlNet-Aux):**\n  `dsine.pt` + `depth_anything_v2_vitl.pth`\n\n---\n\n### \u26a1 3-Step Quick Start\n\n1. **Prompt (Zone 1):** Enter subject description in `Base Subject Prompt`. Leave `Albedo Lighting Suffix` attached to prevent pre-baked shadow seams.\n2. **Light (Zone 3):** Select a preset on `StudioLightRig` *(e.g. Rembrandt Classic)* or drag light heads on the live 2D Studio Radar.\n3. **Queue:** Pass 1 extracts 3D geometry at Step 10; Pass 2 synthesizes photorealistic lighting at Step 30.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Production Calibration Rules\n\n* **Pass 2 Denoise (Zone 5):**\n  * `0.45 \u2013 0.50`: Strict facial identity lock (catalog beauty).\n  * `0.55 \u2013 0.60`: **Calibrated Sweet Spot** (subsurface scattering, leather reflections, skin wrap).\n  * `0.65+`: Extreme Chiaroscuro / Film Noir.\n\n* **Specular Kick (Zone 3 - Composite):**\n  * `0.40 \u2013 0.50`: Universal standard for mixed materials (skin + wool coat + leather bag).\n  * `0.00`: Pure matte black wool (prevents edge solarization).\n\n* **Stand Distance (Zone 3 - Rig):**\n  * `0.8m \u2013 1.5m`: Close, dramatic falloff; background architecture drops into darkness.\n  * `2.5m \u2013 4.0m`: Soft, broad ambient coverage.\n\n---\n*Created by METAMATERIAL // github.com/maciejtajber/ComfyUI-StudioLight*\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# \ud83d\udca1 StudioLight: Method A Calibrated\n### Professional 3-Point Photometric Lighting Console\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udce6 Required Models & Storage Paths\n\n* **Diffusion Model (UNET):**\n  `flux1-krea-dev.safetensors` *(or standard `flux1-dev.safetensors`)*\n  \ud83d\udcc1 `ComfyUI/models/unet/` or `diffusion_models/`\n\n* **Text Encoders (CLIP):**\n  `clip_l.safetensors` + `t5xxl_fp16.safetensors` *(or fp8)*\n  \ud83d\udcc1 `ComfyUI/models/clip/`\n\n* **VAE:**\n  `ae.safetensors`\n  \ud83d\udcc1 `ComfyUI/models/vae/`\n\n* **Preprocessors (Auto-downloaded by ControlNet-Aux):**\n  `dsine.pt` + `depth_anything_v2_vitl.pth`\n\n---\n\n### \u26a1 3-Step Quick Start\n\n1. **Prompt (Zone 1):** Enter subject description in `Base Subject Prompt`. Leave `Albedo Lighting Suffix` attached to prevent pre-baked shadow seams.\n2. **Light (Zone 3):** Select a preset on `StudioLightRig` *(e.g. Rembrandt Classic)* or drag light heads on the live 2D Studio Radar.\n3. **Queue:** Pass 1 extracts 3D geometry at Step 10; Pass 2 synthesizes photorealistic lighting at Step 30.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83c\udf9b\ufe0f Production Calibration Rules\n\n* **Pass 2 Denoise (Zone 5):**\n  * `0.45 \u2013 0.50`: Strict facial identity lock (catalog beauty).\n  * `0.55 \u2013 0.60`: **Calibrated Sweet Spot** (subsurface scattering, leather reflections, skin wrap).\n  * `0.65+`: Extreme Chiaroscuro / Film Noir.\n\n* **Specular Kick (Zone 3 - Composite):**\n  * `0.40 \u2013 0.50`: Universal standard for mixed materials (skin + wool coat + leather bag).\n  * `0.00`: Pure matte black wool (prevents edge solarization).\n\n* **Stand Distance (Zone 3 - Rig):**\n  * `0.8m \u2013 1.5m`: Close, dramatic falloff; background architecture drops into darkness.\n  * `2.5m \u2013 4.0m`: Soft, broad ambient coverage.\n\n---\n*Created by METAMATERIAL // github.com/maciejtajber/ComfyUI-StudioLight*\n"
      },
      "color": "#df691a",
      "bgcolor": "#cb5506"
    }
